  "Collect a power core as soon as the lane is safe enough because later waves are balanced around its attack increase.": "Sammle einen Kraftkern ein, sobald die Lane sicher genug ist, da sich spätere Wellen um die Angriffssteigerung herum ausbalancieren.",
